{"id":"event_redash1_01_s","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40031","label":"RED ASH · Part 1"},"label":"Last Resort: A","stage":null,"prev":"event_redash_prologue","next":"event_redash1_01_e","speakers":{"commander":"Commander","liliweiss":"Liliweiss","rapunzel_o":"Rapunzel","dorothy":"Dorothy","redhood":"Red Hood","snowwhite_o":"Snow White","hongryeon_o":"Scarlet"},"icons":{"commander":"si_c942_00_s","liliweiss":"si_c943_00_s","rapunzel_o":"si_c966_00_s","dorothy":"si_c233_00_s","redhood":"si_c470_00_s","snowwhite_o":"si_c224_00_s","hongryeon_o":"si_c225_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_1","text":"All of us in this room know, things are looking bleak.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"BriefingRoom","bgArt":"briefingroom","image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_redash_goddesssquadbriefing","movie":null,"shown":["redhood","snowwhite_o","commander","liliweiss","rapunzel_o","hongryeon_o","dorothy"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_2","text":"4 years ago, the Raptures invaded.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_3","text":"To stand against this naked aggression, the United Forces of Humanity was formed. We fought with all our might, but the battle has increasingly leaned in the Raptures' favor.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_4","text":"To this day, the situation remains largely unchanged.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_5","text":"However, starting 2 years ago, we have experienced the occasional victory. And these victories are occurring more often now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_6","text":"You're right about that. Once the Goddess Squad was deployed to the battlefield, we have been able to secure a small foothold and turn the tide of this skirmish.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_7","text":"Of that, you can all be proud.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_8","text":"The sooner you're proud of yourselves, the better, so you can start now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_9","text":"Wow! Our squad is the best!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_10","text":"That includes you, Rapunzel.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_11","text":"O-okay... I'm proud to be a member of the Goddess Squad.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_12","text":"What's there to be proud of? This was all a foregone conclusion.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_13","text":"There's that snooty Dorothy we all know and love.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_14","text":"Ohohohoho! You may say it's a foregone conclusion, but that's not what most of the general public believes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_15","text":"Dorothy's told you several times before not to call her \"snooty\"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_16","text":"It would be the 56th time if I issue a warning again, to be precise. At any rate, I prefer not to pat myself on the back in such a self-congratulatory fashion.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_17","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_18","text":"The newcomer doesn't seem too proud, either.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_19","text":"How could I be? My time in this unit has been most fleeting.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_20","text":"Furthermore, boasting of past achievements is not something I partake in.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_21","text":"A lot of people would kill to have something to be proud of.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_22","text":"Perchance, but not I. I have but one wish—to become stronger, nothing more.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_23","text":"To place so much credence in the thoughts of others is a sign of one's naivety and inexperience.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_24","text":"That's hardly something you should be saying. You're the one swinging a sword around.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_25","text":"... What do you mean?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_26","text":"Hanging around in the backyard playing war with wooden swords is a favorite childhood pastime, is it not?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_27","text":"If thou thinks my blade is of wooden constitution, then allow me to prove how fallacious that notion is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_28","text":"How about you skip the briefing and head outside to train? At least then we'd have some peace and quiet.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_29","text":"You're all not fighting again, are you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_30","text":"Hardly. We're just having some playful banter.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_31","text":"If I may continue?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_32","text":"We may have had a commendable winning streak during our tenure on the battlefield, but the same cannot be said of our fellow military units.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_33","text":"No matter how well we're performing, we have to look at the situation as a whole. In the grand scheme of things, our contributions don't amount to much.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_34","text":"More than anything, we've primarily served to raise morale. We've given people hope, so that they feel free to dream.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_35","text":"Regardless of our own achievements, we're just a small unit, and our contributions only go so far.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_36","text":"The United Forces of Humanity on the surface are running out of supplies, and have suffered one loss after another.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_37","text":"Raptures have continued to breach the barriers.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_38","text":"The power disparity is evident from nearly every angle, be it the number of their forces or the level of their weaponry.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_39","text":"Would a declaration of surrender be a feasible option?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_40","text":"We're unable to communicate with them in any way, so I doubt that would work.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_41","text":"Did you tell them about my idea of waving a white flag?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_42","text":"Of course I didn't bring up such a ludicrous suggestion.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_43","text":"You don't have to be mean about it...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_44","text":"At any rate, a direct confrontation against the Raptures is a lost cause.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_45","text":"It's painful to admit, but humanity doesn't stand a chance against these creatures.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_46","text":"So an all-out offensive would be tantamount to suicide?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_47","text":"Correct.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_48","text":"Based on our observations of the Raptures' movements thus far,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_49","text":"we've been led to believe they operate according to a linear chain of command.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_50","text":"All of them appear to only have basic input functions except high-ranking Raptures.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_51","text":"In other words...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_52","text":"There's a head.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_53","text":"Huh? Don't they all have heads?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_54","text":"That's not what I meant.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_55","text":"I don't get it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_56","text":"Basically...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_57","text":"A leader of some kind.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_58","text":"Precisely.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_59","text":"Ah, so the big cheese?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_60","text":"The big what?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_61","text":"That's what we call the boss or leader in my neck of the woods.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_62","text":"Can I continue?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_63","text":"Go right ahead.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_64","text":"Our mission is clear.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_65","text":"We need to take out the big cheese.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_66","text":"Er... I mean,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_01_s_67","text":"we need to take out the Rapture's leader.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_01_s_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key"